# Repointed at the Laravel admin's own /api/v1 (MailProxyController): stores
# every lead form submission (Forms.js, Contact.js, GetNewInsight.js,
# Login.js quick-quote — all via the shared app/lib/useOtpFlow.js hook) in
# the admin panel, then forwards the identical payload on to the real
# mail.futuretouch.org service so the existing email notification still
# fires exactly as before. No frontend code changed to do this.
